Never call Supabase directly from UI.

Flow

Component
↓
Hook
↓
Service
↓
Repository
↓
Supabase

Validate every payload.

Use typed models.

Enable Row Level Security.

Repositories own all Supabase client usage.
Services own validation and orchestration.
Admin / service-role clients are server-only.
